From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Victor Momplet <mompletvictor@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 11:04:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(scores): marks see the data they are judged on

The session mark was asked to weigh recovery, sleep, goals and the last 48 h but
received none of them: it now gets the GOALS line, the session day's Charge,
sleep, Rest and HRV, and every workout of the 48 h before it (with sets when
logged). The meal mark gets the day's burn (so far and projected for today) and
its workouts with their times. Both only with the coach's data consent.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
